      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This paper reviews the scientific literature on four procedures: Coronary Calcium Scoring (CCS), Lung Cancer Screening (LCS), Computed Tomographic Colonography (CTC), and Whole Body Computed Tomography (WBCT). No published studies demonstrate that these procedures reduce morbidity or mortality when used to screen healthy, asymptomatic patients."},
